eplay events. Whether you prefer tactical teamwork or going in alone, you decide how you take on the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.poster.avif?t=1791807696\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.webm?t=1791807696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.mp4?t=1791807696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.avif?t=1791807696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/c0d776fcc809fedc1ac9f58e35fb9d74.webp?t=1791807696 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Arena Breakout: Infinite, fair combat is a guarantee with our ever-improving, anti-cheat system. This includes Killcam Replays that allow you to submit a one-tap report whenever you flag suspicious activity. Moreover, if you’re confirmed to have lost a match due to cheating, automatic in-game compensation will hit your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.poster.avif?t=1791807696\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.webm?t=1791807696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.mp4?t=1791807696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Arena Breakout: Infinite is a high-stakes tactical extraction shooter where every decision matters. Fight, loot, and extract—or lose it all. With stunningly realistic visuals, lifelike sound, and unforgiving PvPvE combat, every raid is a gamble between glory and ruin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, German, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Arena Breakout aims to be a steely military simulator.”<br>IGN<br><br>“Arena Breakout: Infinite is a fun game that I can see myself turning to again and again.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“If you are a fan of realistic military shooters, you should definitely check out Arena Breakout Infinite.”<br>Sportskeeda<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/eccc13f9398a6af599a78ec7a437d6540f43a3c5/header.jpg?t=1791807696", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/4d7e3b2a565f2606a0a95494e064664b6d6e6949/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791807696", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/4d7e3b2a565f2606a0a95494e064664b6d6e6949/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791807696", "website": "https://www.arenabreakoutinfinite.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></